sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant REST as REST Gateway<br/>8080/TCP
    participant gRPC as gRPC Server<br/>8085/TCP
    participant Runtime as Caikit Runtime<br/>(Dispatcher)
    participant Local as TextGeneration<br/>(Local Module)
    participant TGIS as TextGenerationTGIS<br/>(TGIS Module)
    participant TGISClient as TGISGenerationClient<br/>(gRPC Client)
    participant TGISServer as TGIS Server<br/>(Remote Backend)
    participant HFHub as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,HFHub: Flow 1: Local Inference (HuggingFace Transformers)
    Client->>gRPC: gRPC Request<br/>TextGenerationTask
    gRPC->>Runtime: Dispatch to registered module
    Runtime->>Local: run(text, ...)
    Local->>Local: Load model via PretrainedModelBase
    Note right of Local: First load downloads<br/>from HuggingFace Hub
    Local->>HFHub: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443
    HFHub-->>Local: Model weights + tokenizer
    Local->>Local: Transformers inference<br/>(torch, accelerate)
    Local-->>Runtime: GeneratedTextResult
    Runtime-->>gRPC: gRPC Response
    gRPC-->>Client: Generated text

    Note over Client,HFHub: Flow 2: Remote TGIS Inference
    Client->>REST: POST /api/v1/task/text-generation<br/>HTTP/8080
    REST->>Runtime: Dispatch to registered module
    Runtime->>TGIS: run(text, ...)
    TGIS->>TGISClient: generate(request)
    TGISClient->>TGISServer: gRPC: GenerationService.Generate<br/>TLS/mTLS (configurable)
    TGISServer-->>TGISClient: GenerationResponse
    TGISClient-->>TGIS: Raw generation result
    TGIS-->>Runtime: GeneratedTextResult
    Runtime-->>REST: HTTP Response
    REST-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Client,HFHub: Flow 3: Token Classification
    Client->>gRPC: gRPC Request<br/>TokenClassificationTask
    gRPC->>Runtime: Dispatch to registered module
    Runtime->>Local: FilteredSpanClassification.run()
    Local-->>Runtime: TokenClassificationResults
    Runtime-->>gRPC: gRPC Response
    gRPC-->>Client: Classification results

    Note over Client,HFHub: Flow 4: Tokenization
    Client->>gRPC: gRPC Request<br/>TokenizationTask
    gRPC->>Runtime: Dispatch to registered module
    Runtime->>Local: RegexSentenceSplitter.run()
    Local-->>Runtime: TokenizationResults
    Runtime-->>gRPC: gRPC Response
    gRPC-->>Client: Tokenized sentences
